WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,000
Classmate Li Mo, congratulations on becoming the number one scholar

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,440
The headquarters just gave a reply

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,800
I can give you a gold membership card

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,120
But the term is only five years

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,920
Let's go in and eat and talk. We can wait a moment.

6
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,440
My parents are still behind

7
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,660
Give me the contract

8
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,060
I sign now

9
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:23,710
It's a little too hasty. Bring it here.

10
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,750
Don't sign this contract

11
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,750
I'm sure you won't be able to settle down.

12
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:32,160
Thank you Li Mo

13
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,920
Then I won't disturb your meal.

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:34,960
Arrange now

15
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,640
Regarding the transfer of your endorsement fees

16
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:46,660
Mom, there's a million in this

17
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,860
You guys put it away

18
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:51,890
one million
